}5 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],$ we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}y}{|}_{{y}_{0}}=[\\begin{aligned}5 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 6\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n- The function $y$ acts on a vector $x\\in {R}^{2}$ by multiplying it by $A$ and outputs a vector $y(x)\\in {R}^{2}.$ Thus,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=A.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}f(z(y(x))){|}_{{x}_{0}} & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}z}{|}_{{z}_{0}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}y}{|}_{{y}_{0}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}{|}_{{x}_{0}} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}5 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 6\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}5 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-7 & 21 \\\\ -2 & -24\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}5 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}28 & 63 \\\\ -82 & -102\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531633 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186204101 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "12de0411-fa8a-5be0-9d80-3e174cf92707" :knowledge-point/title "Differentiating the Composition of Three Functions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5c7514df-e1bc-5812-a620-8cfb7a50c83d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & -3 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531067} {:answer/id #uuid "8b6d48ab-68bb-5c1b-8407-c446fe6de522" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531169} {:answer/id #uuid "943602fe-250f-5da7-8665-bfa193685cee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 175921865311